{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 615,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b9f2a121edb3930bd38f7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘的历史产生了变动。\\n就在我以此曲歌舞之日，\\n世界便迎来了黎明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebbe14b6a4ffd536cb54cb4a59ca47d07a90c3deb97b970823ec23f46f9d74d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "44"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35083b523250431ef120b6fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请问这里面，有没有漫画改编的\\n动画歌曲之类的？就是那种能让\\n创作欲望猛烈涌现出来的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87cec5c6001c934ac57f6c343f69e8668d21d5304958fbcc189c25253a8e25d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "440"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e304b22614e151cad4359e4b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好的音乐会永远流传下去——\\n我也想成为，一直留在大家记忆里的\\n“最强”赛马娘呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b1d15c35a9131dbcbe4a2373ce4f904e0f4ce0560791765c586a733ef3de581",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "441"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e439dc164b0754deba0b0758",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我经常听音乐呢。\\n毕竟在为了赛事\\n调整心情的时候再合适不过了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8b5c54faa185d5bff7132e39dc4e3889fb2f0b04bf9e1a49be9e023ee5f2eab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "442"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3968b7122921c37e9a107393",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "什么『进化论』我才不管呢！\\n我可不选别人走过的路。\\n我要贯彻到底，只属于我自己的进化！",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e3d594a610ec8540f099992210868abbdadc9e8d00206ba8d93de04e2e13a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "443"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b7be5cf756e720dc45a0f48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一心一意地笔直向前，不断磨砺。\\n这正是职人应有的姿态呢。\\n……我也，一定会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "279877447faa92d91f370d6a81b7e8696db41d977b17df770838b32ed980a852",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "444"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d086eeddf5be6119445172",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好几次都被歌词鼓励了呢。\\n即使被高墙阻挡，也绝对不会放弃。\\n因为我也想在这里，闪闪发光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b5cca228f59d03583636d45bca0f96965d6cb6d6b5f39f4aa92ada9715423e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "445"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f95bfe098fba634e6aac5965",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "被憧憬所引导，我也是一样的。\\n梦中见到的景色，以及那前方的未来。\\n……好想，二人一起去看看啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc4c852962ee2586772dee130b396d8afa16451b4307412b915a7a8d4211ac1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "446"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:990a6cdc5e42650bd7a143ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这是在火焰中，由强者编织而成的歌。\\n演奏着，迈步着，然后前往『新天地』。\\n……接下来该去向哪里呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59439cdd7074f7b53ef2cbecf75c2bdfeffd41ad392928f756ab03195e613f19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "447"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f25ce7256eeec0b9fc52edda",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与同世代的劲敌，擦出火花的\\n激烈碰撞……咕～，这是最棒的热血展开！\\n我也要，把它描绘出来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bad636eef636cefaaaa39f7d5aca12e96ad33c760f8eefc5ccde52b9661a3d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "448"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77ac33ee5b06a4f9602586f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果是这首纯朴又充满偶像风格的曲子，\\n王道可爱的莱斯酱最合适不过了！\\n自己的光辉，就必须要自己来创造哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53529c2fa6f36d2bc4864554ad6b7685a66c1e6021fa914ae6296c86ff4431f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "449"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ebf46093773cd16cb02221d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊～彷佛现在仍能听见……\\n那赞颂霸王的合奏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a80cfdfa7feccc4507f44c176703dfa21777d98591f48f5ec8a2b5f9847c687c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "45"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53c2ca25685cf67da2647a03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "点缀着鲜艳历史的三后冠。\\n我是绝对不会输给过去的杰出人物的！\\n超越一切、取得胜利的会是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f31e1451d32ae12d32696a1a14ba9d7b6c34d8812a6b78ccc4ac1d7d98105443",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "450"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c29e57831c709871d40dff9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～这简直就是，洗完澡后\\n想一手拿着咖啡牛奶唱的歌。\\n训练酱，要不要来合唱一曲？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5097e052cd4d7457e5d9455c18e42f60eadba6bf0d67be6dd5bb1db3649fffaa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e282e13dc6f407a0537cf3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "摇摇晃晃，轻飘飘的……呵呵呵。\\n总觉得是一首让人心里暖洋洋\\n的歌呢……哈呼呼♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "423f0354fa9ab4c8881186b9f90ca73b409e80fe613c9359a481aa6e82ebb6a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "452"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f3abc23fb0484bc62a87c06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "充满亲切感的曲调和歌词……\\n和意气相投的伙伴一起欢唱欢笑……\\n真是招揽客人去温泉的最佳曲目呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38977cc804edfce8bb99f4eeb807a50680a903e056f01cafac639d42a33c9080",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "453"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fdb033497ed2376beab62c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不要听我的歌听到头晕脑胀啦，你\\n快打起节拍来！因为我会让你嗨到\\n身体的最深处都热起来哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59c2ab98719e5136410a20aad2a7224c5cb3b8108d858316f1730f910f6ee564",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "454"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc0cf196aae59709ad564103",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "注入了心意的磁带……我虽然没有录音\\n功能，但是可以留在『记忆』里。\\n那段在温泉热气中的欢乐时光",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e0c5561dade698e54527c96be1930a3dba428b9f3b1bfe4323ffb08d183929e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "455"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d763db2168b01099ca5e14e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "回到宿舍，就有快驹酱的\\n「欢迎回来」在等着……这种\\n平平淡淡的感觉，果然很好呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "c56ea0be32b8c0db650bd167f2f24a53bfb382ae94d5e71126b71f9caf03275f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "456"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8be20ab727a1ed5cb40f6fc5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下次，也想和医院的孩子们一起唱啊\\n随着跳跃的节奏，合着声音……。\\n愿大家的每一天，也能变得温暖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e15d5e8afceb42b795a815ac4565a8971c2e1d63fca6e5ddad9a74d134a2100",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "457"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8215a20dc6a2fc0aefffb69e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一个人做不到的事情，如果是和重要\\n的人一起……呵呵。希望能如歌词所写\\n那样，铭记于心地生活下去呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bcb158f81fec638c2a513205f45c8924fc1ffc6e42fef16efb436457dad716b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "458"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57d9230b842fc90e157cbdee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我最喜欢这首曲子了！每个人都\\n有出场的机会，说『我们』……\\n就好像大家都能成为主角一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6878d47be1a4400ed36a6ad808a344f3e75d1f43b1c57030f43f36af471cc298",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "459"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:554541ad6202a2f866760d2b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跟称号无关。\\n我只是想一直赢下去……\\n今后……也都一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ecdb682ddc71bf699b406ece92fecbab76a69bed95f6e34f2c28a2073527afe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "46"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e13ddcb5fa2987c2da3ecf3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很美的曲子，却带着一抹寂寞。\\n不要说什么「再见」，而是马上\\n相见吧，好啦你好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "591f82d6956118cdcf2ac6ed8e03cfd3837c201930d9706172b58209b199855b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "460"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84ffe273d68cac906976874f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听着这首曲子就能看到了。\\n每当回首一路奔跑而来的日子，\\n总会在那里……看到玉藻的身影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ee7682a69ad124dfe5eee184c70899018c40d6619e15980f843b4d02509831d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "461"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad4cc3c95512d8cdcfcf65cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "小栗突然就抱了过来。\\n我懂这首好歌让人伤感啦\\n但是……我们不是每天都见面吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1af242435610311f373a5ef6f39dc8dee4329643f3efcb3b7c8d98c2c8ef2bb7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "462"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bffd82e9232b09fcb00c70cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这种不顾一切的疾驰感，太棒了！\\n我们无论何时都是“挑战者”\\n理所当然要热血沸腾起来嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4dc8c222b38c2b3de3062cdabd0203339b65ec1d7ba969e27571667212c92a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "463"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac772a259e2ddd5412e137d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真不错呢，从劣势逆转的戏码！\\n我也会描绘出来的哦。充满戏剧\\n性、最最热血的故事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4b0f8e41e3da85a6e757cad4db3eca0256115119a38e6b7df77ea98c506bb3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "464"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:350d3363b1c39d695fa5d78b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首曲子真让人心潮澎湃呢。仿佛能让人\\n不畏挫折，一直奔跑下去……。\\n就像是被你推着后背的时候一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d15800a0ba84cb3ac869648c5436a571639aa8014c8d22d844c15564dff1da28",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "465"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc3fa041308abea6e9f175a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "登场要华丽～？哈，这不是挺懂的\\n嘛。在我的字典里，\\n可没有朴素这个词啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c82e1054c75a8ca9e3877727cfc8032565e8db8b10da022f6cd2629789a4fc4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "466"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83a30a5e05ff42794668c1cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "超越语言，将声音汇聚。\\n去向世界上的所有人，传达心意\\n……呵呵，真是首热烈的曲子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad798d84a360bf9e6b9ccd0346b6107dc7cc83d5089bce041d3fbfb0276bead4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "467"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:358750a71ca0634b6d2bc63c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "宛如镶嵌着光芒般的美丽旋律……\\n虽然显得有些虚幻，但那光芒一定\\n比星星的光辉，还要耀眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "118f95a238b31d793a005473195e279a9011c02a4d58043b3e34e5a9d9947e2c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "468"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4993a22c303ef31ee4d25ce1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在无法奔跑的时候听这首歌。就会被那种疾驰感、\\n和不言放弃的呐喊推着后背，\\n然后想到。『我还想继续奔跑』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e1803710108204fccb2a13aa52c6c78515f5be1a10df81faacfc8ef181f488b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "469"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2590248e58ca7314a120096",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我已不再迷惘……\\n看着吧，我会证明的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90c32635895afc62cfc2f09ef3684025af6e340e960da767dd1a3cf896a0e285",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "47"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c200eb94316b0b51c1e188",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "闭上眼睛，歌词描绘的情景就会浮现\\n出来。啊啊……我也，必须绽放才行。\\n像坚强而华丽的母亲一样，鲜艳地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3becb622cb1659d1106419eae4c46894f00e6b7d4b6b2cac42ac7f918ca66c81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "470"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:689eae0379bd7c7db6431033",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以轻柔的步调，慢慢地……♪\\n就像这首曲子一样，我想要\\n和你永远一起走下去～",
      "source_fingerprint": "803b4b4c30cbaed27b8f799c022fd220811d729260895b43df9aaa746c045d4c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "471"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9570888a1e1c3ed492011d81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这正是，公主的主题曲！\\n华丽、优雅且勇敢地！\\n我要去豪迈突破☆啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84f9e6d149be6dd05f3197e51bea515555fd63435ca38981ce78c59403d33ea7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "472"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58f09826d3e4b783e0e73bea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有什么是不可能的！绝对！\\n因为Sweepy的魔法，会把这个世界\\n变得闪闪发光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe0bfe2a87c6cf44007a88d78dbff868c970a2d4f8b7222e78b9e404f6a3afff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "473"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac389538768b82e011101e84",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "留下印记。留下痕迹。将和小真一起\\n听过这首曲子的事。\\n……请你，一定要记住哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec2b61986cc47d100e9a10cd1372be15ec550ca6ed5174d83b5d9e603561895f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "474"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77833d7fd532c7ccb85e24da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "仿佛有一阵清风吹进了心里……。\\n听着这首曲子……就会让人觉得，\\n想要试着向前迈出一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb6ba86f372005c7821e15e13baf052416af21b79ec3682f689252e5ece62568",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "475"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bd63d5d22df62a257fc8d74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "音乐，真好啊……。\\n倾听者的心灵相互共鸣，简直就像\\n整个世界都融为了一体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d29e9de80e194336833f46ba63db4356c9c8d3fac0e163af5a2475c24cde2856",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "476"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:330c9644dc53a018b5b34f6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "平时我经常听那些舒缓的\n抒情曲呢。……因为即使在忙得团团转时\n也能让心情平静下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "429cdef2e60166ba6ed593e945738504ba73d203b7e263908943e47d2272a27c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "477"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ef4ee7be472c9b8b1deb6e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……这个嘛，姑且不论。\n不知道有没有、\n纯音乐的版本呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e82a4e11f200922fb309f10517e420f594bfcfac087e407d7f561a5e217dbbbf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "478"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a88cfb8b6829a46e4ac05c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那群家伙啊，只要我\n一拿起麦克风，就会乖乖地站好位置哦。\n很可爱吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f39991a03d915d3cb901a5a0a7d80a085507e5d4a36110cb00d487889dee0d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "479"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c61188a03b7bbfec2481648",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是要选到什么时候……\\n快点决定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b81a3140301157154c33997ca5adb4e4d1ebbeb92c0a89b62a80a9672f51d443",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "48"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50302120635218e96cd21b91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为尽是不拘一格的人，\n所以调整录音日程着实费了一番苦心……\n但也正因如此，才成就了这首绝妙的乐曲吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "d64c624944a516259399494c385516fc150cd00e0dc55ede92a09108be51511a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "480"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:389152343c06a0d967afe709",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可恶……是黄金船吗？还是梦之旅……？\n擅自把这首歌的CD、\n寄给老师的家伙是……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7160f4aa5b6370294c53185e7cd73a1a6b2f1bd6d5d3a72a28742e5d3679c02f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "481"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3399f84b147c8afb33a731f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "倾听吧。\n这是仅由极致的黄金编织而成的旋律，\n绝不允许以半吊子的态度来拜听。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39302ecb1c8865d0785352c3fdf882b2d7e8fd4594094a1275e9d041d689c8e0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "482"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15f16122851a2b6510eff704",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "便宜啦便宜啦～，现在那个\n柔软的图腾柱只要区区\n5金点……哎，不要吗？笑",
      "source_fingerprint": "49ee28abd76810f56b9d05c715b46846a74ff4ba769cf1f57146ebcdea2fb07d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "483"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90d8f1506279c86fbb58e271",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不知为何每次唱这首歌时大家似乎都会\n眼泪汪汪的……难道说本官、\n因为太投入表情变得很可怕吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb1847daa892f557cc8f833e6a54603c145fa96c679f3fb74bfe6cd3a360f914",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "484"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7debeb612dda4a1651d4ffd0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "举起双手，yay yay！\n让心情高涨，yay YAY！♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d09040b197b51b10371cd5b97ddcceb8b1daa7c0f61c7366f0b63d84bebb7ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "485"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffdbcd98bb356e834172f626",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "推荐听些平稳的曲子，\n享受安详的休憩时刻。如果您期望的话\n我也可以为您伴唱哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a506b0c9c986543315706c565fb29bdb1905b5f320b7dfdc90b1baef26ea841",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "486"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:effa931dd30d44d474fe81c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "歌声与歌声重叠――\n才得以初次诞生的音色。\n和声真是美妙的东西呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3075957117a1cc9638ab4d6686a40766c0d0ffa5f2e5152baf6c59c7ed6fdbf1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "487"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9939a04f39117c5cba03bc9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我比较喜欢爵士系的呢。\n能让头脑变得清晰，效率也会\n跟着提高，用来当背景音乐正好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb0682e72403b8c0ef9ba753d3418b2a7e65e8d11d2d60b10cc4037267b1f45b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "488"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c05f80171a4ea252bd8e58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我年轻的时候啊，也曾为了尝到金黄炸鸡\n在加油站打过工呢。\n喏，这是那时候的照片☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b861e644e1bce4bc639de5737eaf7f2bd7196698ccc0f0d13817d228b9a3b25a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "489"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edea41186bed73778e70e0d2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我并不讨厌像直接抓起麦克风架\\n那般豪迈奔放的举动喔。\\n呵呵，感到意外吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dc6f30ed14206ecb717cbf051032d854d72c96530b42a5a292b62651a7641fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "49"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:150420b1db1fdde4ffd570aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一杯烘托出炸鸡风味的咖啡。\n……在这段悠闲的时光里，\n我甚至感受到了一丝怜爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86d4fa28737f4e27b34a728db838556c6ba4d057235f49c483e34bc77d400b6c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "490"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44687bd5dfc67f1186bdb8e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很中意上校脆鸡柳呢。\n蛋白质丰富，最重要的是没有骨头！\n可以轻轻松松补充营养呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c47a55cf54a9f92d09e42cd4a1fca756c179af88020b2b47ebaa9965b3c4a0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "491"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:611e897a25274a9b2b26860f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵，真好吃啊……胡萝卜\n炒河粉风味的薯条！下次，\n想叫上宝穴酱一起去吃呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a61c47c679fc5b580bc792dff2af75aa4dc8389b867a89dd569c2876b13f943",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "492"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f3f5c316dec7517240ad310",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以前大家曾用好多炸鸡办过\n家庭派对呢。全家人都满脸笑容……\n好想再办一次啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e196e3f5052e343e63d2a12659021d76f194b4afc30510b7b43e943af6188f07",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "493"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed0a85914802714a0ff98620",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊啊，这旋律正是赞美美食的\n赞歌！就用圣女的歌声\n传达给各位吧……汝，大口咬下去吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "283f27dc929ab79842405338622b49b8f560da62573aa75fccf779920d4d2b96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "494"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:342af068aa37cf325ff13c33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给自己的专属奖励……我很喜欢\n这句歌词。忍耐之后品尝心爱之物\n的那份幸福，我真的很懂呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff085a38b3ad41cc420822e26e72917926eb5520262eebc614e75b8dde6ba66e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "495"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d71eba0643da04c69f964ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随心所欲地走进旅途中发现的小餐馆。\n只要碰上一家好店，\n这趟旅程就会变得难以忘怀，就是这么回事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32d0e198cd23cff524e0cbe09874956874101ea26a437d32ec82b1c1b0d7ac40",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "496"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b991e69530a19d7d8249768",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "告诉我你最喜欢的一首歌吧！\n那对我来说，\n也一定是一首命中注定的歌曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20c92345317b7d4ec5f19b78647329e55ba2cecac2cd15097b54dc49451afed3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "497"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acc28a7e6147621c18d51ef0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要心怀『认真的梦想』，\n就能无所畏惧地勇往直前。我也有\n这样的梦想……那就是将世界连结在一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e614542501ff139ae6bc2a2f9e04da5bfcc0e438fceb48da99a82c7a1aa983b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "498"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:341a2629e1b5a0e2fc5b2d16",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "（这首歌的C位，是货真价实\n后冠路线的“焦点”――绝、对\n不会放手！绝不相让！绝不交给别人……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ee340250ea28fb4a5057b8c93e7f208e4500b27f2f4513dbe3ad1abbe0af02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "499"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d4e21bab42ff466f9fa1a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听了之后……脚步变得好轻盈。\\n感觉可以一直、一直奔驰下去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebdbe38a0f4fa87e3df82557c62a31841aff2f12d95956939cc09cc818826ce1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4564ecdc72df2689fefe04d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "募集……MUSIC……噗。\\n……没事，你继续选歌吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f9356390cde8f9fbc28d243f143b089529a511e7ead7941e1603ef5bcb7a7a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "50"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c35c18fb7fe8ce9e26180c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌的舞蹈练习？\n……不妨先参考一下\n气槽小姐的演出影像吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "600e2ae9637a13caad260322e5d8b8129d95ba4df0732eef2d35856fd4169e68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "500"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1025b1d13b2a0bf403139d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最速女王的宝座，就是用无数闪光\n点缀的舞台对吧……。\nPerfect! 我燃起来了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ce1549ad2d86b0967c2eed99680e74c3c0e3382e9706ea544bbdc78bb0072a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e61909a293bc3de8a56190e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请放心。哪怕在我的力量面前\n苍天坠落、神明惑乱\n……我也必定会引领前路♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "114fe01b3f596cebb9e082674f4d0afdd6a7d0bfd798e913e695dbabb290c0d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a853b6da26c8061e1bd20c0a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢――这首歌的编舞。\n不仅是C位，舞台上所有人的动作\n都华丽而和谐地融为一体……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "322b8a39af5436a9eda1fe5db710d6a7515301a387e158fc89f1b00ded451a06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69fc132c58c4259cfc544e2c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『对手越多』……吗。哼，\n确实，要是连国王和王后都没有的棋局，\n可就毫无支配的意义了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b92340ba7c77b2a2fcb531fb5d9575432d766c83fc2abca0d25a92e2cb34dcf7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "504"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ef8824c2277cd08ab4b258",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这首歌的演出能看清夜空中的群星，真棒！\n只要预感到有流星，\n就能马上告诉大家了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94948b6748e56fb99f710ee9c15838bb1e6bca67784c96fba2f2d9dd1821f3e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2fd652a57536399690fb0b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想翻译歌词给家里人看……\n但真的挺难的！\n特别是跟拉面双关的那部分……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c004027841d8104e11e473042ba26f727654dfbd8134880f620a8d7ce0996f7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "506"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1f5602777695a0ea5d85342",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说学园附近的拉面店，每天\n都在放这首歌呢！\n就当顺道去道谢，要不要一起去吃呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "47275f478699db8cd1ba630104c609213258818511c1853a39ed463a3bb197b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "507"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a02809606c3da0b7e7ea5057",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "多少次被这首歌勾得满脑子都是拉面……\n又有多少次大半夜忍不住\n泡了方便面啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b593de90794e4a7ed281af03dad9c3d05d91e0021a42c1b100e546fa55e78614",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "508"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c70447e67fe390d2d5020a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『一碗、十碗、百碗、千碗』――\n哎呀真是啰嗦。\n一开始直接点一千一百一十一碗不就行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "564dfb8d564b43a0cfebd50cb43d119bf84c4af7905108b94ac70c278cf5cb74",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "509"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a3a810d32d58ca77aca9dcd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "怎么了？笑容也是一种\\n很重要的表演。\\n当然会做到完美吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fcb36d3006e1abb761e4572980faf213a8c9d657f7764f4e2fb0d7fe6b5fdd2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "51"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f3daf45c87b2d272397ff23",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "人家本来是听着歌等泡面泡好的说……\n可是，不小心听入迷了……\n呜呜，面条都泡烂了～……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c3e92af6536e3265d4191c7f4330a534243bb6c527dfb8c6f636d2e30803415",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "228",
        "510"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
